Files: vendor/iced_tiny_skia/*
Copyright: 2019 Héctor Ramón Jiménez and the iced contributors
License: MIT
 The iced software renderer, vendored so AuraPass can carry one patch:
 `present()` always damages the whole window instead of relying on automatic
 frame diffing, which composited overlapping translucent layers more than once
 and made panels darken. The patch is marked with an "AuraPass patch" comment in
 src/window/compositor.rs. Upstream: https://github.com/iced-rs/iced
Comment: The pure-Rust software renderer for iced; the patch is AuraPass's own
 work and is offered under the same MIT OR Apache-2.0 terms as the rest of
 AuraPass.

